xed point</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha^{-1} = T_{\\mathrm{EM}} + \\alpha H(1 - \\hbar_q^2 \\alpha)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N_v = T_{\\mathrm{EW}} - N_v^{-1} H(1 - \\hbar_q^2 N_v^{-1})</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/electroweak-higgs-torus-link-triplet-table1-data.md","heading":"Table","page":"b/tbl-electroweak-higgs-torus-link-triplet-table1-data","qa":{"counts":{"pass":40,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":57}}}
